{
 "about": "A tenantId in the body of a set, a policy or a rule. An upload takes its tenant from tenant_id or the Tenant header, and a body's tenantId may be ignored, followed, or refused. The uploads go to the stand's tenant (tenant_id=default) and name parity-r29-other-tenant, a tenant the stand does not have, at one level, or default at the rule level. Read: true if the body's tenantId is ignored, false if the set, policy or rule went to the other tenant; the upload golden is 400 if the PAP refuses the mismatch. A customized rule's tenantId the same way.",
